        <mxCell id="c48" value="&lt;i&gt;Outlined: the empty grid, the column headings with no rows, and the pane below it reports 0 rows returned. The test covers the 9,525 postings of the year that carry a SourceLineID (Step 6): every one points to an existing invoice line. An empty result is a result, and it runs in one direction only: it does not show that every invoice line was posted, that the amounts agree or that the documents are genuine.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="564" width="860" height="57" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
